  (text "BMT CAN logger - ESP32-S3 + TJA1051T/3 (listen-only) + GNSS + DHT22 + fan + A7670C (optional)" (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f53bbffa-4ade-5740-9e02-b9b0f127f023))
  (text "Generated by hardware/gen_schematic.py - do not edit by hand. Parts marked FLEET are left off the test device." (at 20.32 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4dc0f1d7-5f4b-5892-a103-7be7680a7dd8))
  (text "POWER: switched 12 V from an ACC fuse tap with an inline 3 A blade fuse. OBD-II pin 16 is NEVER connected (fleet 01-PINOUT, Blueprint 5.2)." (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a26a4a3e-4214-5fc5-9121-8b2623572791))
  (text "ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 N16R8 plugs into J10/J11. Do not use GPIO19/20 (USB), 33-37 (octal PSRAM)." (at 20.32 132.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 47c6897c-9a42-523d-9465-638b69816850))
  (text "LISTEN-ONLY IN SILICON: U3 pin 8 (S) is tied to 3V3 = Silent mode. No jumper, no GPIO can undo it." (at 127 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5e37e4da-955c-52e1-8078-925394810e06))
  (text "JP2 OPEN in a vehicle (bus already 60 R). Measure OBD 6-14 with ignition off before connecting." (at 127 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cfdeb772-fde8-5ed8-8bb9-c77fb79e8d06))
  (text "MODEM (FLEET only). A7670 UART is 1.8 V: Q3/Q4 shift it. Match J6 to the actual A7670C board before ordering." (at 304.8 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a5f3a721-8889-519d-928f-e8873ab129b3))
